# Secrets live in Infisical (project: starterkit). This file only lists key names; never commit real values.
# Infisical dashboard: https://app.infisical.com  (docs: https://infisical.com/docs/documentation/getting-started/introduction)
#
# Two ways to get a working .env:
#   1. Infisical:   `infisical login`, then `pnpm secrets:seed dev` fills what it can generate and
#                   lists the rest (see packages/env/README.md).
#   2. No accounts: `pnpm setup:local` writes a root .env for running on one machine.
#
# When a package adds a key, add it here too, with a comment saying what it is and where to get it.

# --- api (Infisical path: /api) ---
# development | test | production. Defaults to development.
NODE_ENV=development

# Set to 1 to skip validation, for CI builds that have no secrets. Never in production.
SKIP_ENV_VALIDATION=
